            "sha256": "a1ae75171b8f161b1e1b477ba183ee1f853cbd9e94fb56873f8572bd8acbcf13"
          }
        },
        {
          "purpose": "record immutable historical support and pending boundary",
          "before": "Future consumer evidence is pending and null; none is inferred from the old four failures or this sealed protocol.",
          "after": "Future consumer evidence is pending and null; none is inferred from the old four failures or this sealed protocol.\r\n\r\n## Supported supervisor derivative\r\n\r\nThe parent 0bea packet remains immutable. Its four installations naturally completed 0/0, but configure failed before a subject was created: stderr was Unknown option, and configure ready/owned JSONL, consumer bindings and runtime were absent. Missing subject records are not natural closure. The original 0f35213c failures also remain unchanged.\r\n\r\nAll four fresh configurations use the sealed host x64 copy at F:/work/sm05-compiler-tail/out/actual-compiler-tail-6df2df34-3e84-4f05-bffa-efbfbb555e1f/OwnedProcessRunner.exe (150016 B, SHA-256 015d0802aa62dbdbf00eca48f200d821a0f3b6a2a42896fc55ecaef3f5197bbe). Its normal build directly compiled owned-process-runner.cpp plus owned-tail-evidence.cpp. Actual CL/read, OBJ, LINK/read/write and PE x64 console bytes bind this exact executable; all three source files equal the broker versions at author time.\r\n\r\nrunner-origin.json pins the 6df2 historical actual source/tool evidence and both x64/x86 contexts/raw tails. The existing binary actually accepted image/hash/nonce and emitted start, prelaunch pin, snapshot, cleanup and terminal. Those runs kept generic passed=false, root/supervisor 0/124 and forced owned-Job cleanup; the historical 30 s drain is not this packet's unchanged 2000 ms drain. Parameter support proves neither current consumer success nor natural/resource qualification. The separate 9c838 reader failure is not used as successful evidence.\r\n\r\nOnly packet/output paths, actual supervisor path/size/SHA, eight fresh configure/build nonces and corresponding frozen control pins differ from 0bea. DELTA.json replays every modified file forward and backward to the exact original bytes. The SDK producers, install map, BinderConsumer, driver, policy, args other than fresh paths, budgets and qualification flags are preserved. This author executed filesystem operations only; future outputs remain absent.",
          "count": 1,
